  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Inside Heavenly Court, Fang Yuan in single qi crane form opens his beak and blows white qi from Myriad Year Flying Warship. The white qi spreads, entangles the back of the warship, and the house’s speed rises sharply as it shoots forward. Conventional wisdom holds that a qi path killer move would not help a time path Immortal Gu House. Fang Yuan modified moving qi ring himself; it is rank eight, and a vast number of qi path dao marks raise its power by a thousand times, pushing the warship forward against that logic. He passes several Northern Plains immortals and reaches the immortal graveyard first, while Duke Long realizes the problem and chases.",
